1
00:00:00,434 --> 00:00:02,634
(Sheldon:)You mixed them.
No wonder gentleman callers

2
00:00:02,703 --> 00:00:04,803
(Sheldon:)are pounding down your door.

3
00:00:07,208 --> 00:00:09,478
(Sheldon:)Do you have any questions
for me?

4
00:00:11,045 --> 00:00:12,975
(Amy:)Just one.

5
00:00:13,047 --> 00:00:15,947
(Amy:)Are you doing okay?

6
00:00:16,984 --> 00:00:19,924
(Sheldon:)I am.

7
00:00:19,987 --> 00:00:21,557
(Sheldon:)Good.

8
00:00:21,622 --> 00:00:24,792
I-I want you to be happy.

9
00:00:24,859 --> 00:00:26,959
(Sheldon:)I believe you.

10
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:33,830
(Sheldon:)I'd believe you more if you
threw a few Apple Jacks in here.

11
00:00:37,405 --> 00:00:40,445
(Man:)Here you go.
Thanks.

12
00:00:40,508 --> 00:00:42,278
(Howard:)You got to be kidding me.

13
00:00:42,343 --> 00:00:43,913
(Man:)Sorry?

14
00:00:43,978 --> 00:00:46,778
Y-You're Elon Musk.

15
00:00:46,847 --> 00:00:47,847
(Sheldon:)I am.

16
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:55,460
Wh-What are you doing here?

17
00:00:55,523 --> 00:00:57,693
(Elon:)I'm washing dishes.

18
00:00:57,758 --> 00:00:58,888
(Sheldon:)Well,

19
00:00:58,959 --> 00:01:00,589
(Elon:)I was on the turkey line,
but I got demoted

